sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title YuPay - Click Shop API payment

    participant U as Customer (web or miniapp)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant PAY as payments.service
    participant CG as ClickGateway
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant CL as Click (Click Up / my.click.uz)
    participant CSVC as click.service
    participant FUL as fulfillment.service

    Note over U,CL: pending_payment order, currency == UZS

    U->>API: POST /payments/intents order_id, provider click or click_miniapp
    API->>PAY: create_intent(order_id, provider)
    PAY->>DB: SELECT order FOR UPDATE, status == pending_payment
    PAY->>CG: create_intent(db, order, return_url)
    CG->>CSVC: build_checkout_url(provider, order_id, amount_soums, return_url)
    CSVC-->>CG: intent_url = my.click.uz/services/pay?service_id=..&merchant_id=..&amount=..&transaction_param=..&return_url=..
    CG-->>PAY: PaymentIntent external_id, intent_url, status pending
    PAY->>DB: INSERT payments provider, status pending, external_id
    PAY-->>U: 201 intent_url
    U->>CL: open pay link (web link or miniapp openExternalLink)

    Note over CL,API: Click is now the webhook CLIENT - it drives our<br/>POST /payments/click/prepare and /complete (form-encoded, MD5 sign_string)

    CL->>API: POST /payments/click/prepare click_trans_id, service_id, merchant_trans_id, amount, action 0, error, sign_time, sign_string

    API->>API: read raw form fields (never a request model - missing field -8)
    API->>CSVC: secret_for_service(service_id)
    alt unknown service_id or blank secret
        API-->>CL: 200 error -1 SIGN CHECK FAILED
    else secret resolved
        API->>API: verify MD5 sign_string over raw wire strings
        alt signature mismatch
            API-->>CL: 200 error -1 SIGN CHECK FAILED
        else signature ok
            API->>API: action must equal 0
            alt action not 0
                API-->>CL: 200 error -3 Action not found
            else action ok
                alt inbound error is negative (Click aborted)
                    API->>CSVC: cancel by click_trans_id, service_id
                    CSVC->>DB: PREPARED row (if any) to CANCELLED, cancel pending payment only if still pending
                    API-->>CL: 200 error -9 Transaction cancelled
                else inbound error is zero or positive
                    API->>CSVC: prepare(click_trans_id, service_id, merchant_trans_id, amount)
                    CSVC->>DB: existing txn for click_trans_id, service_id?
                    alt replay of an existing PREPARED row
                        CSVC-->>API: same merchant_prepare_id (idempotent)
                    else first time
                        CSVC->>DB: SELECT order FOR UPDATE by merchant_trans_id
                        alt order missing
                            CSVC-->>API: -5 User does not exist
                        else order already paid
                            CSVC-->>API: -4 Already paid
                        else order not pending_payment
                            CSVC-->>API: -9 Transaction cancelled
                        else Decimal(amount) mismatch
                            CSVC-->>API: -2 Incorrect parameter amount
                        else amount ok
                            CSVC->>DB: INSERT click_transactions status PREPARED, ensure pending payment for provider
                            CSVC-->>API: click_trans_id, merchant_trans_id, merchant_prepare_id, error 0 Success
                        end
                    end
                    API-->>CL: 200 JSON result above
                end
            end
        end
    end

    opt buyer completes payment, Click debits the customer
        CL->>API: POST /payments/click/complete click_trans_id, service_id, merchant_trans_id, merchant_prepare_id, amount, action 1, error, sign_time, sign_string

        API->>CSVC: secret_for_service(service_id) then verify MD5 sign_string
        alt unauthorized or bad signature
            API-->>CL: 200 error -1 SIGN CHECK FAILED
        else signature ok and action equals 1
            alt inbound error is negative
                API->>CSVC: cancel by merchant_prepare_id
                CSVC->>DB: PREPARED row (if any) to CANCELLED, cancel pending payment only if still pending
                API-->>CL: 200 error -9 Transaction cancelled
            else inbound error is zero or positive
                API->>CSVC: complete(click_trans_id, service_id, merchant_trans_id, merchant_prepare_id, amount)
                CSVC->>DB: SELECT click_transactions FOR UPDATE by merchant_prepare_id
                alt not found or click_trans_id, service_id, order_id mismatch
                    CSVC-->>API: -6 Transaction does not exist
                else already CONFIRMED
                    CSVC-->>API: -4 Already paid (replay)
                else already CANCELLED
                    CSVC-->>API: -9 Transaction cancelled
                else Decimal(amount) mismatch against txn.amount
                    CSVC-->>API: -2 Incorrect parameter amount
                else amount ok
                    CSVC->>PAY: settle_provider_payment(payment, external_event_id click_trans_id)
                    PAY->>DB: payment.status succeeded, order.status paid
                    PAY->>FUL: start_for_order(order_id)
                    CSVC->>DB: UPDATE click_transactions SET status CONFIRMED, complete_time
                    CSVC-->>API: click_trans_id, merchant_trans_id, merchant_confirm_id, error 0 Success
                end
                API-->>CL: 200 JSON result above
            end
        end
    end

    Note over API,CL: Every response is HTTP 200 - success or error alike.<br/>A stray non-POST request on either path answers -8, never a 405.

    Note over CSVC,DB: apps/scheduler click_timeout job: PREPARED transactions<br/>with no /complete after 30 minutes are cancelled via the same<br/>cancel() helper, guarded to only touch a still-pending payment.
